T:Jim Wilkinson's Lancers
% NFF Book 2016
S:collected from Jim Wilkinson, Carrowbrook, NSW
S:John Meredith Collection, NLA
B:J Meredith, R Covell, P Brown, "Folk Songs of Australia Vol 2", UNSW Press, 1987, p102
N:The first 8 bars were also collected from Eileen McCoy as: "Polly Go Milk The Cow".
N:Line 3 is a version of: "McGinty Lives Over the Way".
N:It was collected in Australia from a number of informants,
N:including from Harry McQueen as: "Bill McGlashan's Jig".
